<title>USA: Clinton to visit Venezuela.</title>
<headline>Clinton to visit Venezuela.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton is expected to include Venezuela during his tour of Latin America and the Caribbean in May, a U.S. official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official, who declined to be identified, said the White House was likely to make a formal announcement of the Venezuela visit later on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The White House announced in February that Clinton planned to visit Barbados, Costa Rica, Brazil and Argentina May 6-13.</p>
